# run_tests.sh and `set -u`

Root cause: generated `run_tests.sh` used `PYTHONPATH=...:$PYTHONPATH` with `set -u`, so verify failed with `PYTHONPATH: unbound variable` even when product code was correct → stuck_loop.

Host-seeded `run_tests.sh` must avoid unset vars (`${PYTHONPATH:-}` or export only when needed). After Test Architect edits, optionally sanitize or prefer host template.
